"  me=b.user;settings=Object.assign(settings,b.settings);syncBoxes();loadLogo(settings.logoV||\"\");loadWm(settings.wmV||\"\");if(b.accDays)ACCD=b.accDays;if(b.appUrl)APPURL=b.appUrl;if(b.leadDays)LEADD=b.leadDays;applyMe();TODAY=b.today;sheetUrl=b.sheetUrl;lastRev=b.rev||lastRev;",
